  "notes": "Cause code remains TBD/provisional per FORM-366 despite narrative attributing direct cause to the damaged/disconnected flex hose; root cause of the physical damage itself is stated as unknown/undocumented. SRV71B's actual safety function (opening) was unaffected; only the OPEN-position indication to the Control Room via MS-PS-300B was lost. No SIMILAR_TO edge emitted: narrative states no previous occurrences of a similar failure were found in the last three years. No BACKED_UP_BY edges: no operable backup instrumentation stated for MS-PS-300B during the inoperable window; turbine bypass valve response was used only for confirmation, not modeled as a backup system."
